# Hired Claw is a Lizard: attacking with it triggers "1 damage to target opponent" (20 -> 19). Its {1}{R} ability needs "an
# opponent lost life this turn" and works once each turn: on turn 3 before the attack no opponent has lost life, so it is
# refused (positive control: after the trigger resolves it is allowed); a second activation the same turn is refused. The
# +1/+1 counter makes it a 2/3, so combat damage is 2: 19 - 2 = 17.

